{"type":"step-attempt","step":"code-review","sessionId":"4e6763a9-a28d-4bd1-b3a5-7b68b9e0a9af","outcome":{"verdict":"approved","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/finding-wontfix-disposition/review-feedback-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"approved":true,"findings":[],"evidence":{"checked":18,"skipped":0,"unverified":0},"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"tests/unit/core/decision/decision-ledger.test.ts","title":"TC-012: filterUndecidedFindings を直接テスト（step-completion.ts 経由ではない）","rationale":"spec が「（filterUndecidedFindings 経由）」と明記し task が「成立しない場合のみ最小修正」と規定しているため、この粒度は設計方針と整合する。step-completion.ts は無変更で既存機構がそのまま効く。","line":392},{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/decision/wontfix.ts","title":"gate findings index space に decision-needed findings が含まれる","rationale":"getLatestJudgeFindings は全 findings を返すため --wontfix の index 番号に decision-needed findings が含まれる。指定すると fingerprint 逆引き不能で exit 2 になる。spec note が明示的に受容している挙動。エラーメッセージ 'not found in any reviewer chain step' は文脈が見えにくいが spec が exit 2 で受容済み。","line":67}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-20T14:01:42.978Z","endedAt":"2026-08-20T14:10:37.330Z","commitOid":"bdcd2b1e7836208cb0e65b233acab0220f61f015"}
